===Verb===
{{en-verb|es}}

# To [[squeeze]]; to [[grip]] or hold tightly.
#: ''He '''clenched''' his fist in anger.''
# To [[move]] two parts of something against each other
#: ''[[bruxism|Bruxism]] is '''clenching''' the jaws.''

